CONTEXT Library IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Library
{+ The desired system of the migration cases, with an empty database.
It keeps `title` with its property [UNI], drops `shelf` and the rule `titled`,
gives `loan` another target concept, and adds the relation `author`
with a new blocking invariant `authored`, which the existing data violates. +}

RELATION title[Book*Title] [UNI]
RELATION loan[Book*Member]
RELATION author[Book*Writer] [UNI]

RULE authored : I[Book] |- author;author~
MEANING "Every book has an author."
MESSAGE "Every book must have an author."
VIOLATION (TXT "Give ", SRC I, TXT " an author.")

ENDCONTEXT
